Overreach assets

This folder used to hold OpenFront's proprietary assets (logo, favicon, font,
music, sounds). None of them remain: they are "All Rights Reserved" and not
licensed outside OpenFront. The file names are kept so the build finds the
replacements without code changes.

- images/*: the Overreach logo and favicon.
  Copyright (c) 2026 Yunus Alizade. All rights reserved.
- fonts/OpenFront.ttf: the Cinzel typeface, Copyright 2020 The Cinzel Project
  Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-Cinzel.txt).

Sound effects and music are not included yet.
